    PersistNote["ORDERING INVARIANT<br/>Persist before wake: a launch may fail,<br/>but accepted work must already be recoverable."]:::note
    LeaseNote["COALESCING INVARIANT<br/>Concurrent arrivals share one actor-scoped wake lease;<br/>new startup arrivals join the same bounded drain."]:::note
    DeliveryNote["DELIVERY INVARIANT<br/>At-least-once delivery needs stable IDs, explicit acknowledgement,<br/>and claim expiry that returns unfinished work to pending."]:::note

    Incoming --> Persist --> Presence
    Presence -->|"active / idle"| Notify --> Claim
    Presence -->|"starting"| Coalesce --> Starting
